    },
    {
      "id": "8fdefd51cf3f",
      "source": "Keyframe Animation",
      "target": "关键帧动画",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd00e481cfa1",
      "source": "Setting Keyframes",
      "target": "设置关键帧",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b43fc1234af6",
      "source": "Let’s get moving!",
      "target": "让我们让它动起来！",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3abfcb415486",
      "source": "Most parameters in LiquiGen can have keyframe animation. This means you can set values on specific frames resulting in a parameter that can change over time.",
      "target": "LiquiGen 中的大多数参数都可以设置关键帧动画。这意味着你可以在指定帧上设置数值，让参数随时间变化。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0d5b2bcf6a3a",
      "source": "Let’s say we want our sphere to move up and down.",
      "target": "假设我们想让球体上下移动。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "32980dc5da86",
      "source": "That means we have to alter its Z-position over time.",
      "target": "这意味着我们需要让它的 Z 位置随时间变化。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "67fc056baf04",
      "source": "Select the ",
      "target": "选择 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "57086fd6c626",
      "source": "Shape: Primitive",
      "target": "Shape: Primitive",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7e4e6be7d5a7",
      "source": " node and find the ",
      "target": " 节点，并找到 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b86286df60ee",
      "source": "Position",
      "target": "Position",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "688331a6e382",
      "source": " parameter in the ",
      "target": " 参数；它位于 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "70eefe141fcc",
      "source": "Node Details",
      "target": "Node Details（节点详情）",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "397cf0c2a79c",
      "source": " tab.",
      "target": " 选项卡中。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b38cbaad8688",
      "source": "Click on the ",
      "target": "单击 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1dae796fe22a",
      "source": " circle next to it to set the override state for the parameter to ",
      "target": " 旁边的圆形图标，将该参数的覆盖状态设置为 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "aaf2643a8803",
      "source": "Timeline Override",
      "target": "Timeline Override",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7c7749ef309a",
      "source": "Clicking on the icon next to the parameter will cycle through the different types of override states. So if you now want to get back to ",
      "target": "单击参数旁边的图标会在不同覆盖状态之间循环切换。因此，如果你现在想回到 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "40ab34cff0d5",
      "source": "No Override",
      "target": "No Override",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c5b6869e71e2",
      "source": ", for example, you have to click the icon twice.",
      "target": "，例如就需要单击该图标两次。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cd4ab2ae403f",
      "source": "A couple of things happen when setting the override state to ",
      "target": "将覆盖状态设置为 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c0218b5adea8",
      "source": "Timeline Override",
      "target": "Timeline Override",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a76317861b7a",
      "source": "The parameter shows up in the Timeline tab.",
      "target": "该参数会出现在 Timeline（时间轴）选项卡中。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "210f4647ff4f",
      "source": "The parameter shows up in the Timeline Editor.",
      "target": "该参数会出现在 Timeline Editor（时间轴编辑器）中。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3fb6baf63286",
      "source": "If ",
      "target": "如果 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5455e9bdf23c",
      "source": "Create Key When Parameter Exposed",
      "target": "Create Key When Parameter Exposed（参数公开时创建关键帧）",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c9e220e1b68d",
      "source": " (found in ",
      "target": "（位于 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9926d493e90b",
      "source": "Settings/Preferences…/General",
      "target": "Settings/Preferences…/General",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "79ee42edefab",
      "source": ") is checked a keyframe with the current value appears at the blue playhead",
      "target": "）已勾选，则蓝色播放头处会出现一个使用当前值的关键帧。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "892d2f815947",
      "source": "Let’s make our sphere go up and down using keyframes!",
      "target": "接下来用关键帧让球体上下移动！",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7cd3bfae32b3",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "4db712ab0f8c",
      "source": "You can add a keyframe by ",
      "target": "可以通过 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8a31d9a3b2cf",
      "source": "Double-Clicking",
      "target": "Double-Clicking",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "41f89e505168",
      "source": " or",
      "target": " 或",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "089c6cb467be",
      "source": "Shift-Clicking",
      "target": "Shift-Clicking",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "32a928bf65d8",
      "source": " in the",
      "target": " 在",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b17ebdefc784",
      "source": "Timeline Editor",
      "target": "Timeline Editor（时间轴编辑器）",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6ec4fe679b38",
      "source": "You can also set a keyframe by changing the parameter value in the Timeline Editor.",
      "target": "也可以通过在 Timeline Editor（时间轴编辑器）中更改参数值来设置关键帧。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d7b68b8a4b0c",
      "source": "If ",
      "target": "如果 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "610e3dc3aa40",
      "source": "Toggle Timeline Autokey",
      "target": "Toggle Timeline Autokey",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "11f7482ff4fd",
      "source": " is turned on, moving the sphere in the viewport or altering the value in the properties panel will set a keyframe with the new value on the frame specified by the blue playhead.",
      "target": " 已开启，在视口中移动球体，或在属性面板中修改数值，都会在蓝色播放头指定的帧上创建一个使用新数值的关键帧。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8ecc529cca6c",
      "source": "If ",
      "target": "如果 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "af7ca114fa40",
      "source": "Snap keys to frames",
      "target": "Snap keys to frames",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1c08418aa721",
      "source": " is enabled, the keyframes can only be placed on whole frame numbers. If not, the keyframes can be placed anywhere in between frames.",
      "target": " 已启用，关键帧只能放置在整数帧号上。否则，关键帧可以放置在两帧之间的任意位置。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8aadfa83a71a",
      "source": "There we have it, a sphere moving up and down!",
      "target": "这样就得到一个上下移动的球体了！",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "42ddbe802d25",
      "source": "Timeline Editor",
      "target": "Timeline Editor（时间轴编辑器）",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4b713ef6b9cc",
      "source": "Viewing Keyframes",
      "target": "查看关键帧",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "87e37a4b6726",
      "source": "First, let’s fit the keyframes nicely in our timeline editor. You can do this by using the icons in the top right corner.",
      "target": "首先，让关键帧在时间轴编辑器中合适地显示。可以使用右上角的图标完成这一点。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e72f972c03ea",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "343c350934b0",
      "source": " Pan and zoom the timeline to perfectly fit all the keyframes in view.",
      "target": " 平移并缩放时间轴，使所有关键帧完整适配到视图中。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a5b7be02c3b6",
      "source": " Pan and zoom the timeline to perfectly fit the selected keyframes in view.",
      "target": " 平移并缩放时间轴，使选中的关键帧完整适配到视图中。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "92b09eccca8a",
      "source": " Reset the vertical zoom to default in the Curve Editor. When using ",
      "target": " 将 Curve Editor 中的垂直缩放重置为默认值。使用 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b67db27e8448",
      "source": "Shift",
      "target": "Shift",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "aeeaa8cfede0",
      "source": " click you can also reset the horizontal zoom to default!",
      "target": " 单击时，也可以将水平缩放重置为默认值！",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bfcb1dc9f6d6",
      "source": " Toggle the panel to fullscreen if you want to edit your keyframes with the maximum screen space.",
      "target": " 如果想用最大的屏幕空间编辑关键帧，可以将面板切换为全屏。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7cf134ba7341",
      "source": "You can manually move around the timeline using the following controls:",
      "target": "可以使用以下操作手动浏览时间轴：",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c71d19bf5048",
      "source": "Pan the timeline",
      "target": "平移时间轴",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "13ad1e4bbb18",
      "source": " by holding down the middle mouse button and dragging or by using the scrollbar at the top of the timeline editor.",
      "target": "：按住鼠标中键并拖动，或使用时间轴编辑器顶部的滚动条。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "72958606dedb",
      "source": "Zooming the timeline",
      "target": "缩放时间轴",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4e3d97d3641e",
      "source": " by holding down ",
      "target": "：按住 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ec8807b5d118",
      "source": "Ctrl",
      "target": "Ctrl",
