      "target": " 单击并拖动，可以自由地垂直和水平移动一个或多个关键帧。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8773ccd3ea65",
      "source": "Two more options are added to the ",
      "target": "在 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "10db76ec36b6",
      "source": "Align",
      "target": "Align",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "803610194e80",
      "source": " right-click menu:",
      "target": " 右键菜单中还会增加两个选项：",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f204a84d8abf",
      "source": "Top",
      "target": "Top",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f215d1cfc082",
      "source": " will move all the selected keyframes up to the same value as the keyframe with the highest value.",
      "target": " 会将所有选中的关键帧上移到与最高数值关键帧相同的值。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fa6dbd913415",
      "source": "Bottom",
      "target": "Bottom",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4e52cdf0fbb7",
      "source": " will move all the selected keyframes down to the same value as the keyframe with the lowest value.",
      "target": " 会将所有选中的关键帧下移到与最低数值关键帧相同的值。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c4024f7558c8",
      "source": "Interpolation Mode",
      "target": "Interpolation Mode（插值模式）",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a25960bf63f2",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "a9e026d38df3",
      "source": "The ",
      "target": "“",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "caf7fef7235c",
      "source": "Interpolation Mode",
      "target": "Interpolation Mode（插值模式）",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4502d33cfefc",
      "source": " defines the method of interpolating the values from one keyframe to another.",
      "target": "”定义从一个关键帧到另一个关键帧时数值的插值方法。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4357a87ffda8",
      "source": "You can change the Interpolation Mode of the keyframes in the right-click menu.",
      "target": "可以在右键菜单中更改关键帧的 Interpolation Mode（插值模式）。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "321a8dd40abb",
      "source": "Note that you can mix different interpolation modes on different keyframes.",
      "target": "注意，可以在不同关键帧上混用不同插值模式。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "40f75bbc0db1",
      "source": "The interpolation mode of the first (or left) keyframe will be used between two keyframes with different interpolation modes.",
      "target": "当两个关键帧使用不同插值模式时，将使用第一个（或左侧）关键帧的插值模式来计算它们之间的变化。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ff14143f0fdf",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f26464f6e56",
      "source": "There are a few options:",
      "target": "可用选项如下：",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f53c02bb7e12",
      "source": "Constant",
      "target": "Constant",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1353254f2ef4",
      "source": " will fully change the value when reaching a keyframe without any in-between values. This is the default for animating checkboxes and dropdown menus since they don’t have any in-between values.",
      "target": " 会在到达关键帧时立即完全切换数值，没有中间过渡值。这是为复选框和下拉菜单制作动画时的默认模式，因为它们不存在中间值。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2958bf212dbb",
      "source": "Linear",
      "target": "Linear",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "58788fae60bb",
      "source": " will draw a straight line from one keyframe to another in the ",
      "target": " 会在一个关键帧到另一个关键帧之间绘制直线，并显示在 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "53c74005010a",
      "source": "Curve Editor",
      "target": "Curve Editor（曲线编辑器）",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a9930bd45062",
      "source": ". Values will move from one keyframe to another with a constant speed.",
      "target": " 中。数值会以恒定速度从一个关键帧移动到另一个关键帧。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9250f1586cb3",
      "source": "Smooth",
      "target": "Smooth",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "153315571be7",
      "source": " will generate a smooth line from one keyframe to another. This avoids having hard transitions in values.",
      "target": " 会在一个关键帧到另一个关键帧之间生成平滑曲线，避免数值出现生硬过渡。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c028e49a0c5e",
      "source": "Bézier",
      "target": "Bézier",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f094b2bd1fd",
      "source": " will interpolate the values based on the bézier handles. When using this mode you can see the bézier handles when selecting a single keyframe. You can change the interpolation by ",
      "target": " 会根据 Bézier 手柄对数值进行插值。使用此模式时，选中单个关键帧后可以看到 Bézier 手柄。可以通过 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "37993cc0eea1",
      "source": "LMB",
      "target": "LMB",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "eaf5256bd7b3",
      "source": " and dragging the dots at the end of the bézier handles. A flat part of the curve means the values change slowly and a steep part of the curve means the values change quickly.",
      "target": " 并拖动 Bézier 手柄末端的点来调整插值。曲线平缓的部分表示数值变化较慢，曲线陡峭的部分表示数值变化较快。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a75ed078f1b9",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc12a2ada584",
      "source": "When using the ",
      "target": "使用 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9f69db983c2b",
      "source": "Bézier",
      "target": "Bézier",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "396e52799929",
      "source": " mode, there are a few handle types you can use also found in the right-click menu.",
      "target": " 模式时，可以使用几种手柄类型；它们同样位于右键菜单中。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7b8b6b8da9c0",
      "source": "Aligned",
      "target": "Aligned",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7c695f8215ad",
      "source": " The handles can be moved freely and can have any direction and length. For this type, one handle is always in the inverted direction and has the same length as the other one.",
      "target": " 手柄可以自由移动，方向和长度都不受限制。对于此类型，一个手柄始终位于另一个手柄的反方向，并且长度相同。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9acff9d2e474",
      "source": "Free",
      "target": "Free",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "011ceaaaeb8e",
      "source": " The handles can be moved in any way separate from each other.",
      "target": " 两侧手柄可以彼此独立地任意移动。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7d51e16e63c3",
      "source": "Auto Clamped",
      "target": "Auto Clamped",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e2166f5125b1",
      "source": " This is the default behavior. For this type, the handles can never go beyond the previous or next keyframe. Note that when changing the handles the type will be set to Aligned.",
      "target": " 这是默认行为。对于此类型，手柄绝不会越过前一个或后一个关键帧。请注意，修改手柄后，类型会被设置为 Aligned。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f32593471236",
      "source": "Auto Vectored",
      "target": "Auto Vectored",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "735f5b2cb15b",
      "source": " This will point the left handle towards the previous keyframe and the right handle towards the next keyframe. Note that when changing the handles the type will be set to Free.",
      "target": " 这会让左侧手柄指向前一个关键帧，右侧手柄指向后一个关键帧。请注意，修改手柄后，类型会被设置为 Free。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ea16d2779bff",
      "source": "You can always reset the bezier handles to default for the selected keyframes by clicking on ",
      "target": "始终可以点击 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6f4d1b6c336b",
      "source": "Reset Handle",
      "target": "Reset Handle",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7faec7ef5abd",
      "source": " in the right-click menu.",
      "target": "（位于右键菜单中），将所选关键帧的 Bézier 手柄重置为默认值。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4f49450696dd",
      "source": "Note that you can also change all these settings in the Timeline Editor, but you won’t be able to see the effect it has on the curve or change the Bézier curve.",
      "target": "请注意，也可以在 Timeline Editor（时间轴编辑器）中更改这些设置，但无法看到它们对曲线产生的效果，也无法修改 Bézier 曲线。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6b301dcde53a",
      "source": "Timeline Recording",
      "target": "Timeline Recording（时间轴录制）",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b02e7fe54136",
      "source": "Timeline recording allows you to turn your manual changes to a parameter into keyframes in real time.\nThis can be useful to animate things quickly or to just add that human touch!",
      "target": "时间轴录制可以把你对参数的手动更改实时转换为关键帧。\n这适合快速制作动画，或给动画加入一些手动控制的感觉。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "eaa70963a669",
      "source": "Making a timeline recording takes the following steps:",
      "target": "进行一次时间轴录制需要以下步骤：",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5933d43470f4",
      "source": "Set the desired parameter to ",
      "target": "将目标参数设置为 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "20d2c9b3e6ef",
      "source": "Timeline Override",
      "target": "Timeline Override",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "36e1dad08eda",
      "source": ". This means ",
      "target": "。也就是用 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2dd451491e1d",
      "source": " clicking on the ",
      "target": " 单击参数旁边的 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c1e0a1fe9481",
      "source": " circle next to the parameter. The ",
      "target": " 圆形图标。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "73de44eabc86",
      "source": " icon will appear next to it.",
      "target": " 图标会出现在参数旁边。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "354e7fa81342",
      "source": "Click the ",
      "target": "单击 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b89fefaac7aa",
      "source": " icon or press ",
      "target": " 图标，或按 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a732c3985887",
      "source": "Shift + R",
      "target": "Shift + R",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "151070f6ad53",
      "source": " to start the recording.",
      "target": " 开始录制。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "06e071b4e497",
      "source": "Make the parameter changes you want to be recorded.",
      "target": "执行你希望录制下来的参数更改。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2db62be87b13",
      "source": "To stop recording, toggle ",
      "target": "要停止录制，可以再次切换 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0e30d087323e",
